on mouseUp
  [  0] pushint8 200 ............................ <200>
  [  3] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <200>
  [  5] extcall 49 .............................. cursor(200)
  [  7] pushcons 0 .............................. <1.0>
  [  9] setglobal 8 ............................. brant = 1.0
  [ 11] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 13] thebuiltin 25 ........................... <the frame>
  [ 15] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 17] add ..................................... <the frame + 1>
  [ 18] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame + 1>
  [ 20] extcall 24 .............................. go(the frame + 1)
  [ 22] ret
end
